{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/428521-werewolf-2e-dread-powers","id":428521,"title":"Werewolf 2e Dread Powers","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-04T20:55:06-08:00","id":428521,"title":"Werewolf 2e Dread Powers","content":"So, I'm looking at the Dread Powers section right now and most of them don't have a dot rating, or any <i>use</i> for a dot rating (like, it doesn't reference &quot;your dots in Air Elemental&quot; (for example) for anything).<br /> <br /> Are they supposed to be 1 - 5 things, like Dread Powers from other products, or are they something new with the same name?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I have decided, after some thought, that I don't really feel happy on these forums. I might decide to come back to post. Who knows - but right now, I'm gone.<br /> <br /> So good bye, good luck, and have a nice day.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1170-amechra","name":"amechra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1170_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2316"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T21:00:15-08:00","id":428576,"title":"","content":"Dang it Amechra you sniped me! I was wondering the same thing! Although in my thread I also asked about assigned Dread Powers to Claimed. :P Gotta go edit my post now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If I post any good ideas regarding house rules feel free to use them! Giving me credit is optional! All I want is people to have fun!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4737-afro-luigi","name":"Afro Luigi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4737_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"86"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T03:08:12-08:00","id":428924,"title":"","content":"As per my answer in the other thread - no, Dread Powers in W:tF do not have dot ratings apart from those that have variable effects (like armour or natural weaponry), and for those it's so you can have a quick visual reference for the capabilities of the creature in question.<br /> <br /> Dread Powers are picked for creatures that would have them (like Claimed and Hosts) based on what the Storyteller deems suitable for them.<br /> <br /> There wasn't the word count to recreate a Synthesis style system in the corebook and, without that, there wasn't really the need to arbitrarily put dot ratings on the Dread Powers when I'd prefer Storytellers felt they had more freedom in representing the body-twisting effects and supernatural abilities of the creatures that possess such capabilities.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T11:41:51-08:00","id":429075,"title":"","content":"Even if there was no space for a Synthesis like system, I still think it is a shame to not give them dot ratings, especially as it is possible to include a rework of Synthesis in a future book. But of course it would then also be possible to allocate dot values to the old Dread Powers in that hypothetical book.<br /> <br /> We could always assign dot ratings ourselves to make it compatible with Hunter and the old rules.<br /> <br /> EDIT: Assigning dot ratings is at least something I am planning to do at some point, because I sometimes make Dread Powers available to players for 2 XP per dot (as priced according to Mortal Remains).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/304-penta","name":"Penta","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar304_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"617"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T18:33:27-08:00","id":429553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penta</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/428521-werewolf-2e-dread-powers?p=429075#post429075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">EDIT: Assigning dot ratings is at least something I am planning to do at some point, because I sometimes make Dread Powers available to players for 2 XP per dot (as priced according to Mortal Remains).</div> </div> </div> </div>I've done the same. In my game-canon, it's very possible for certain spirits to have children with humans, the resulting offspring having odd merits and/or dread powers. Having a few dot ratings would be good for helping determine what fits the son/daughter of an Incarnae and what would work with someone with a minor &quot;quirk&quot;.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T05:15:58-08:00","id":430077,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sikla Alkis</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/428521-werewolf-2e-dread-powers?p=429553#post429553\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I've done the same. In my game-canon, it's very possible for certain spirits to have children with humans, the resulting offspring having odd merits and/or dread powers. Having a few dot ratings would be good for helping determine what fits the son/daughter of an Incarnae and what would work with someone with a minor &quot;quirk&quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm... WoD-version of God-bloods... Oh, that'd be amazing..<br /> <br /> I gotta steal that whole cloth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/585-seidmadr","name":"Seidmadr","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar585_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}